WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.400
What do you think I want to achieve with this study?

00:06.400 --> 00:15.580
I believe you wanted to achieve how the humans basically understand how the AI works first

00:15.580 --> 00:26.640
of all and secondly probably how do people interact with it.

00:26.640 --> 00:30.960
What do you think of your AI companion in the kitchen?

00:30.960 --> 00:34.700
The robot you interacted with.

00:34.700 --> 00:42.300
It was a funny character in this game I'd say.

00:42.300 --> 00:46.700
Did you like using blocks to convey your insights to solve the puzzle?

00:46.700 --> 00:56.520
Oh yeah it was very useful and basically made the achieving of my goal possible.

00:56.520 --> 00:56.620
Okay.

00:56.640 --> 01:02.960
Did you like using the text chat to explain why the AI behaved odd?

01:02.960 --> 01:15.760
Oh yeah it was very helpful to basically note down the reasons why I think it's misbehaved.

01:15.760 --> 01:17.640
Are you satisfied in your work with the chatbot?

01:17.640 --> 01:20.200
Why or why not?

01:20.200 --> 01:26.520
I am satisfied because it responded accordingly.

01:26.520 --> 01:33.280
And I didn't really find the places where it hallucinated.

01:33.280 --> 01:39.260
Well of course instead of those mistakes that I was supposed to find.

01:39.260 --> 01:43.840
And therefore I think it was a very good companion in this game.

